  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On the heavenly road of the Myriad Tribes Ceremony, after quantity change Gu, this Gu appears while a Predicament blocks the remaining walkers. According to the group’s turn sequence it belongs to a young rank seven Gu Immortal, the ceremony’s dark horse. After they kill the Predicament and split the meat, that rank seven Gu Immortal takes it. Yellow Bell Tribe Leader tries to recruit him and is told he will consider it. Hei Lou Lan is still on the road with that group. She is not the one who takes it.",
        "chapters": [
          2116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_myriad_tribes_ceremony",
          "gu_quantity_change_gu",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "fac_yellow_bell_tribe",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, Great Strength True Martial keeps walking the Upslope Road and obtains authority Gu and this Gu. Several days after the ceremony, in Eastern Sea, Fang Yuan holds it with ability Gu as a pair of rank eight Immortal Gu. His clone Zhan Bu Du sent into Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven retrieved them. In Fang Yuan’s previous life, Ma Hong Yun entered that place, walked the heavenly road, and obtained this Gu in the end.",
        "chapters": [
          2117
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "legend-and-ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "char_great_strength_true_martial",
          "loc_upslope_road",
          "gu_authority_gu",
          "reg_eastern_sea",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_ability_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_zhan_bu_du",
          "loc_myriad_beast_fusion_color_heaven",
          "char_ma_hong_yun"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As Great Strength True Martial endures the River of Time’s truthful floating ice better than Ren Zu and Carefree Wisdom Heart, fortitude Gu calls out that the credit belongs to it, for having helped him since the start. Narration adds that fortitude Gu can suppress emotions.",
        "chapters": [
          2185
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "claiming-credit-on-the-truthful-floating-ice",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_river_of_time",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "char_carefree_wisdom_heart"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
